--TEST--
Off a connection a later `Core\Response::stream` is a new stream: `end` on the first does not end it, and a `$mustEnd` stream ended inside a capture is not reported — `rule:core-classes/spreadsheet-writes-as-a-stream`
--FILE--
<?nvs
// covers: Core\Response\Stream::end
// The first stream is ended inside a capture. The second stream starts open, so
// its write is sent, and the run reports nothing because both were ended.
var $first = Core\Out::capture(fn (): void => {
    var $body = Core\Response::stream("text/csv", null, null, "first.csv");
    $body->write("a\n");
    $body->end();
});
echo $first;
var $second = Core\Response::stream("text/csv", null, null, "second.csv");
$second->write("b\n");
$second->end();
--EXPECT--
a
b
